// ts_host.sai -- extern declaration for JS host presence probing.
//
// @sa_host_is_bun returns 1 if the current execution host is Bun, else 0.
// Native contract (JEV js_shim_native_zero, lazy const-slot design probe):
// SA native execution runs under the sa interpreter/LLVM with no JS host
// global, so "is Bun" is definitionally false there and the native
// implementation returns 0 always -- this is the contract, not a
// placeholder. The JS target gets a shim in emit_js.zig returning
// typeof Bun !== "undefined" ? 1 : 0. Env-sniffing was JEV-rejected:
// Bun sets no distinctive environment variable by default, so a
// getenv-based probe would be evidence-free.
@extern sa_host_is_bun() -> i32
